    Name: Herbert "Hagbard" N'Myron
    Location: New Reno
    Description: Arguably the most unpleasant individual in New Reno.

    MODULAR VERSION ??? assembled from domain-specific modules.

    STRUCTURE:
    ===========
    [1] Config     ??? config/npc_nhmyron_defs.h
    [2] Headers    ??? include/npc_headers.h
    [3] Variables  ??? inline (globals)
    [4] Forward Decls ??? inline
    [5] Defaults   ??? procedures/npc_default_procedures.ssl
    [6] Combat     ??? procedures/npc_combat_procedures.ssl
    [7] Dialogue   ??? procedures/npc_dialogue_procedures.ssl
    [8] Masters    ??? inline (start, spatial only)

    Total lines: ~50 (vs 200+ in monolithic version)
    Compile target: scripts/npc_nhmyron_modular.ssl
*/

// ============================================================
// [1] CONFIGURATION
// ============================================================
